size 16 16
// Sapcane Candy (Glasswing + Mudgrub treat): a lump of boiled sapcane sap, amber and glassy, on a reed stick.
gradramp sap 8 #5a2a04 #8e4a0a #c47614 #e8a028 #fcc85a #fff0b0
gradramp reed 6 #2a3414 #44521e #62722a #82903a #a2ac52
layer stick
line 3 13 7 9 reed.2
line 4 13 8 9 reed.3
px 3 14 reed.1
layer candy
key C #e8a028
grid 0 0
